        <mxCell id="footer" value="&lt;b&gt;Build checks:&lt;/b&gt; Use molded contact numbers, not left/right positions. Two separate wires per cable; no cross-short or ground.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;S4:&lt;/b&gt; contact 3 = GPIO3, contact 2 = GPIO7; contacts 1/4 unwired. C1/C4 in S4 are incomplete, not valid.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rollout:&lt;/b&gt; New C2/C3 IDs replace old catalogue meanings. Deploy reviewed firmware and page together. See CABLE-BUILD-PLAN.md." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#334155;fontSize=19;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
